{{also|Sénégal}}
==English==
{{wikipedia}}
[[File:Senegal w1 locator.svg|thumb|right|Senegal]]

===Etymology===
Probably from a {{der|en|pt|-}} transliteration of the name of the {{w|Sanhaja|Zenaga}} (possibly from {{der|en|ar|زنجي||Zanj, Negro}}, from {{der|en|fa|زَنگ||Land of the Blacks}} ''Etymology 3''}. Or a combination of the supreme deity in {{w|Serer religion}} (''Rog Sene'') and ''o gal'' meaning ''body of water'' in the {{der|en|srr|-}} language.

